To force a text field to display text in columns using Adobe JavaScript, you can use the `setTextFormat` method to apply a text format with a specific character and paragraph spacing. However, this method is typically used for rich text fields, not simple text fields. If you're working with a rich text field, here's an example of how you might set the text to display in columns:

```javascript
// Assuming 'richTextField' is the instance of your rich text field
var columns = 2; // Number of columns
var charSpacing = 0; // Character spacing in twips (1/20th of a point)
var paragraphSpacing = 0; // Paragraph spacing in twips

var textFormat = new TextFormat();
textFormat.paragraphSpacing = paragraphSpacing;
textFormat.characterSpacing = charSpacing;
textFormat.alignment = TextFormatAlign.LEFT;
textFormat.font = "Arial"; // Specify the font you want to use
textFormat.size = 12; // Specify the font size

// Set the text format to the rich text field
richTextField.setTextFormat(textFormat);

// Set the number of columns
richTextField.setColumns(columns);

// Set the text to display in columns
richTextField.setText("Your text goes here, and it will be displayed in columns.");

// If you want to insert the text at the beginning of the field
richTextField.setSelection(0, 0);
richTextField.setText("Your text goes here, and it will be displayed in columns.");
```

Please note that the above code is for a rich text field, not a simple text field. If you have a simple text field and you want to display text in columns, you would typically need to use a third-party component or a custom solution, as Adobe's standard text fields do not support column formatting natively.

If you're working with a rich text field in a Flex or Adobe AIR application, the above code should work. If you're working with a web application, you might need to use CSS to achieve a similar effect, as JavaScript does not have built-in support for column formatting in text fields. You can use CSS properties like `column-count` and `column-gap` to create a multi-column layout for text.

